    <string name="rules_matrix_title">Move Hierarchy &amp; Powers</string>
    <string name="rules_rock_desc">Beats Scissors and Iron. Loses to Paper, Ice, and Steel.</string>
    <string name="rules_paper_desc">Beats Rock, Iron, and Steel. Loses to Scissors and Ice.</string>
    <string name="rules_scissors_desc">Beats Paper. Loses to Rock, Iron, Ice, and Steel.</string>
    <string name="rules_iron_desc">Beats Rock and Scissors. Loses to Paper, Ice, and Steel.</string>
    <string name="rules_ice_desc">Freezes and beats Rock, Paper, Scissors, and Iron! Only loses to Steel.</string>
    <string name="rules_steel_desc">Crushes Rock, Scissors, Iron, and Ice! Only loses to Paper.</string>
    <string name="rules_single_player_title">Single Player Mode</string>
    <string name="rules_single_player_desc">Play against AI in a 10-round match. Use special items from the shop to defeat challenging moves. Win matches to earn Cash and climb the leaderboard.</string>
    <string name="rules_two_player_title">Two Player Mode</string>
    <string name="rules_two_player_desc">Play with a friend on the same device. Select moves secretly and reveal outcomes in real-time face-to-face.</string>
    <string name="rules_online_title">Online Multiplayer</string>
    <string name="rules_online_classic_desc">• Classic Mode: Only standard Rock-Paper-Scissors and custom skins allowed (no special items).</string>
    <string name="rules_online_hard_desc">• Hard Mode: Special shop items (Iron, Ice, Steel) are enabled and can be used during matches.</string>
    <string name="rules_online_rooms_desc">• Private Rooms: Create or join rooms with a 6-digit code. The room host decides whether special items are allowed.</string>
    <string name="rules_online_forfeit_title">5-Round &amp; Abandon Rule</string>
    <string name="rules_online_forfeit_desc">• Abandon Penalty: Quitting an active match records a Loss and an Abandon stat on your profile.\n• Remaining Player (Over 5 Rounds): If the opponent quits after round 5, you win by forfeit (+200 Cash &amp; Leaderboard points).\n• Remaining Player (5 or Fewer Rounds): If the opponent quits early (round 1-5), the match is voided (no win/loss) to prevent win-trading.</string>
